    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start, but the \"against\" side feels a bit too easy. Can you actually give me a real argument against nuclear deterrence—like a serious one that a smart opponent would use—and then show me how to dismantle it using the logic from your first speech? I want to make sure my student can crush even the strongest points.",
